      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "用户点击后以本人身份直接提交 Transfer 决定，成功响应核验后才恢复；409配approval_request_mismatch或410配approval_expired显示安全本地化原因，其余失败保持通用提示，不额外检查、恢复、重试或启动。",
        "en": "User clicks submit a Transfer decision as that User; only verified success resumes. Exact 409/approval_request_mismatch or 410/approval_expired pairs select safe localized reasons; other failures remain generic with no extra check, resume, retry or start."
      }
    },
