        "zh-cn": "批准确定性调用一次，消费后只查；拒绝／过期固定无执行收尾，不因修订变化重开运行确认，不明结果不重发",
        "en": "One deterministic approved start and read-only observation after consumption; rejection/expiry finish without execution or renewed review on revision drift; no uncertainty retry"
      }
    },
