      "sha256": "9f447025d15d60a147659b01eb1938f6fd07218d6b5f0a92ac35ba58c7b2b627",
      "use": {
        "zh-cn": "保留正式过期结束等待、移除按钮及刷新保持的断言；增加决定失败的双语过期／不匹配提示及非法组合反例，不据失败提示改变交互状态，零恢复与刷新重发，未知Owner正文不展示。",
        "en": "Retains formal-expiry completion, button removal and reload assertions; adds bilingual decision-expiry/mismatch feedback and invalid-pair cases. Feedback never changes interaction state, resumes or replays on reload, and unknown owner text stays hidden."
      }
    },
